            <ArticleTitle>Pain management in the child with sickle cell disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>595-9, 613</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Vaso-occlusive crisis is the most common complication of sickle cell disease. Ongoing education, appropriate assessment, and adequate analgesia will provide effective relief for the child in pain.</AbstractText>
